ue in TranslateManager, and only use it in TranslateManager, so why store it in TranslateState? LanguageState is a per navigation state, and IIUC, your property is not,…"],["60725fe2_e5b8b884",52,-9,1,"false?"],["943b2fa3_29148928",53,-9,1,"any way to add a unittest?"],["c629ee74_6e5e0cb7",90,-9,1,"is the test reversed? IIUC, it should be translate_manager_->GetLanguageState()->support_auto_translate() && !details.has_notranslate;"],["334a8c3e_5b4f2224",52,-8,1,"very optional: \"support\" seems a bit strong here as the TranslateManager does support autotranslate, we just disable it."],["d2dd5afa_b09ba963",53,-8,1,"should support_auto_translate_ be tested here?"],["d61cd5c9_24ba757f",54,-8,1,"isn't this supposed to be called by LanguageDetermined?"],["d546f615_043eb666",49,-7,1,"optional nit to maybe consider now that you have that many test: You can create ReaderModeTranslateInfobarTestBase that inherites TranslateInfobarTestCase to make these config easier"],["24d41022_c74df620",54,-5,1,"I know other tests are not well documented but could you add comments for what are you testing and expecting to happen? After seeing this test for the first time again in months I was very confused…"],["400f0874_afad571e",53,-5,1,"nit: enable->enabled"],["7407c6bf_77b240fb",53,-5,1,"nit: enable->enabled"],["1d0d239d_f49ad267",54,-2,0,"Is this included to test that manual translations still work?"],["d8b1e953_bd5964f7",54,-2,0,"Shouldn't the page alread be in French? What is the purpose of this line?"]],0,843],[7253353,20439,120,2.078,1.66,[[1,0.698,529,87],[13,0.252,3,28],[3,0.029,44,3],[14,0.022,8,2]],[["13d5ad4b_819f7d3f",91,-2,1,"Putting`feature_engagement::events::kIOSReaderModeChipExpanded` as the trigger event here means that it'll be fired automatically by the FET whenever…"],["f1331aa0_806e259e",92,-2,1,"When you use `ShouldTriggerHelpUI`, the FET tracks which IPH are currently shown, so you need to call `Dismissed` when the IPH dismisses."],["5a801a91_f03c08da",92,-1,1,"I 